  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="e924cf91-5727-5a7d-8b56-7e51374ab901" activityNameId="38ac6c80-7cf7-58eb-a63a-19518320f609" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Lime, algae, at regional storehouse</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Lime, algae, at regional storehouse
Values originate from a single producer of lime from algae in France, which, however, can be considered typical for the Swiss market.;
UUID: fc187590-66b2-3f17-9aea-fda4ad9fef23
The inventory contains transports connected with the collection of the algae from the sea ground and the delivery to the fertiliser plant as well as the distribution of the usable product to the regional storehouse. Energy requirements for drying of the algae from a water content of 25 % per weight to a final water content of 2.5 %, and milling of the algae were taken into consideration. Demand of the resource calcite contained in the algae was included. Infrastructure and land use were included by means of a proxy-module.
Location: The values refer to the market situation in Switzerland. The production takes place in France.
Technology: Values refer to a commonly used technology for this product.
Time period: Year when data for the inventory were communicated
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data retrieved from a manufacturer in France. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fc187590-66b2-3f17-9aea-fda4ad9fef23.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
